  "rationale": "No optimization has all preconditions verifiably met for this workflow. P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT is the only measured CI-workflow experiment, but its precondition (representative successful-duration history) is unmet — the repository CI history shows only failures with measurement 'not_a_measured_baseline' — and its demonstrated 5-minute job timeout contravenes the valid slow iOS/macOS build jobs (contraindication: valid slow runs exceed the proposed limit), with no history available to set a different safe budget. P-LIT-GHA-CACHE fits the repeated `melos bootstrap`/`flutter pub get` in every job, but its evidence is observational with an illustrative unexecuted pseudocode example, and cache inputs (pubspec.lock locations) cannot be verified without repository files beyond the workflow itself. P-LIT-FAIL-FAST requires a matrix, which this workflow lacks. Preserving all build/test coverage, no change is supported.",
  "evidence_ids": ["P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT", "P-LIT-GHA-CACHE"]
}
